{"product_id":"celestial-blade","title":"Ebony wood x Celestial Blade (Butt only)","description":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eInspired by the elegance of a legendary sword, the \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCelestial Blade\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is a handcrafted ebony cue butt that embodies precision, artistry, and timeless design. A meticulously handcrafted abalone sword inlay shimmers under the light, beautifully contrasted by the rich black ebony and clean white ringwork for a striking, sophisticated look.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDesigned for discerning players and collectors, the Celestial Blade showcases exceptional craftsmanship and premium materials. Whether matched with your favorite shaft for play or displayed as part of a collection, this cue is a true statement of style and performance.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWeight:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 17 oz\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eButt Length:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 29.5\"\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePin:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Radial\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWood:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Premium Ebony wood\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eInlay:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Handcrafted Abalone Sword design\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eConfiguration:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u